cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalog in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "K3s Solution Catalog for ISO/IEC 42001-Compliant Industrial AI Systems"
abstract: >-
  A structured catalog of K3s-compatible Helm chart solutions for designing,
  deploying, and governing AI systems in manufacturing environments in
  conformity with ISO/IEC 42001:2023. Solutions are organised by deployment
  tier (Edge, Platform, Enterprise) and functional category, with explicit
  mapping to ISO/IEC 42001 Annex B requirements. Companion artifact to the
  doctoral thesis "Automatización de operaciones en el ciclo de vida de
  soluciones para fabricación cero defectos" (Mateo-Casalí, Universitat
  Politècnica de València, 2026).
